{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/p65STJ0SrqufxqU-bST3Cw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:13.796729+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/p65STJ0SrqufxqU-bST3Cw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5UcenObib98Nj7zk5UgCF4dl6k94FyuXJesGwWx8UXPPKo9KJtfjahGag/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsHUIRx8SsHYNr69j24mjVPY8jnXia1QQSMibP9DYOE88fzcdGeH2CWmQg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/lSfDibrUsADeMkez9FG6m5ibhO7icv0ibodISVI3gSJk8swibPZGGnBAK2pEIu2ZkGJI2QviawBEBPTlz2I5YdMACHrQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span> 1.</span><span><span>研究所简介</span></span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5Umbic71T2ibA8olF6h7cvC8wyPNOOkrGDdkDIz9y4sseUoJlYFFmI0uSQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5UktSPwgG15b5taxpibdjIaN3qrpabEibflC5PYX9x1usPKfwxPngOel5A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>生物医学光子学与传感研究所</span></strong></span><strong><span>依托生物医学信息工程教育部重点实验室，围绕人与健康领域国家重大需求与前沿科学问题，将光学与生物学、医学深层次交叉融合，发展特色关键技术与方法，开展与健康及重大疾病相关的检测和诊疗科学问题及核心技术的研究。“十四五”期间，生物医学光子学与传感研究所针对生物医学问题，开展光学检测、光学成像、光学诊疗、光学仪器等研究工作，构建有组织、有梯队、有布局的学术科研和人才培养平台，力争形成特色鲜明、成绩突出、国际前沿的学术组织体系，以改革促发展，实现一年一台阶的跨越式发展，引领西安交通大学生物医学工程光学领域方向。</span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>平台目标</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>面向人口老龄化以及重大疫情等国家公共卫生事件应急处理及快速反应的重大需求，聚焦光学技术在生物学研究和临床应用中面临的活体分子快速成像、衍射极限、微观过程与宏观影像的衔接等挑战，借助分子标记技术，发展新型成像模式，开发新的计算方法，构建新的理论模型，突破光学检测成像深度、速度与精度瓶颈，实现疾病快速检测与精准微创诊疗，开发具有自主产权的诊疗设备。建成国内一流的光学传感与分子精准诊疗平台。培养具有深厚理论基础的医工交叉创新型人才，形成具有国际视野、勇于探索的科研教学团队。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究方向</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>主要围绕光学传感、光学诊疗、光学影像开展：</span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>→ </span></strong></span><span>生物医学光谱传感技术与仪器</span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>→ </span></span></strong><span>光致发光分子平台开发及应用</span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>→ </span></span></strong><span>人工智能与肿瘤精准成像</span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>→</span></span></strong><span> 纳米医学及慢性疾病的代谢调控研究</span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>→</span></span></strong></span><span> 生物医学光学仪器开发</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIs1IG5xeLKibAGU3jQSHJG97SicZqucyj6kKo3grRjBTWYtQYdibLSHg6Sw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/lSfDibrUsADeMkez9FG6m5ibhO7icv0ibodISVI3gSJk8swibPZGGnBAK2pEIu2ZkGJI2QviawBEBPTlz2I5YdMACHrQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.研究成果</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5Umbic71T2ibA8olF6h7cvC8wyPNOOkrGDdkDIz9y4sseUoJlYFFmI0uSQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5UktSPwgG15b5taxpibdjIaN3qrpabEibflC5PYX9x1usPKfwxPngOel5A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>科研项目</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>研究所围绕光学传感、光学诊疗、光学仪器方向，近年来承担和完成国家重大科研仪器研制项目（</span><span><span>780万</span></span><span>）、国科金重点项目（</span><span><span>310万</span></span><span>）、国科金重大国际合作研究项目（</span><span><span>265万</span></span><span>）、 省重点研发计划（</span><span><span>200万</span></span><span>）等项目，累计科研到款近</span><span><span>4500万</span></span><span>。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2024年期间获批国科金面上</span><span><span>2项</span></span><span>、国科金青年</span><span><span>1项</span></span><span>、横向项目</span><span><span>8项</span></span><span>、省部级项目</span><span><span>3项</span></span><span>，实验室开放基金</span><span><span>1项</span></span><span>，总计立项科研项目合同经费</span><span><span>552.06万</span></span><span>元；科研到款</span><span><span>565.79万</span></span><span>。</span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学术奖励</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>研究所获国家科学技术进步奖二等奖</span><span><span>1项</span></span><span>、省部级科研获奖</span><span><span>3项</span></span><span>、厅级科研获奖</span><span><span>2项</span></span><span>。出版</span><span><span>8本</span></span><span>专著，包括“十四五”时期重点出版物出版专项规划，并获重大出版工程规划项目。</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIseWxxsdDaD3hWFeiaXE1ZdiaEGe2f5f1hPyBICbkIX0I2Sjy1icLX9kHhw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学术论文</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>研究所近年来在Nature Chemistry, Nature Communications, Nature Reviews Clinical Oncology，Journal of the American Chemical Society，Nano-micro Letters等高水平国际期</span></strong><strong><span><span>刊发表SCI论文</span><span><span>180</span></span><span>余篇。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>其中2024年在Advanced Functional Materials、Biomaterials、Analytical Chemistry、Bioactive Materials、 ACS Sensors等著名期刊新增高水平SCI科研论文</span><span><span>31</span></span><span>篇。</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsjUq20xkQWW3erbLpLMauK7pdVSagXDgbSiaeAyZvdHC7RiaGzfRBtadg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>专利软著</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>2024年新增申请发明专利</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>项，授权</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>项，转化专利</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>项，合计</span><span><span>4.06</span></span><span>万元，校企合作成果显著， “产学研”成果稳步发展！</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIs9yXuolnICKSiaOYrB4y3QRtzojxoswW958YWxeFw9iblJkME635Shjyw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/lSfDibrUsADeMkez9FG6m5ibhO7icv0ibodISVI3gSJk8swibPZGGnBAK2pEIu2ZkGJI2QviawBEBPTlz2I5YdMACHrQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.平台建设</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5Umbic71T2ibA8olF6h7cvC8wyPNOOkrGDdkDIz9y4sseUoJlYFFmI0uSQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5UktSPwgG15b5taxpibdjIaN3qrpabEibflC5PYX9x1usPKfwxPngOel5A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>研究所配备先进实验平台，涵盖荧光传感、光疗纳米材料、纳米探针芯片、光谱传感仪器、光学成像诊疗与智能导航等，为新型探针研发、痕量检测、诊疗纳米技术、微创设备等提供强力硬件支撑，奠定新型成像与诊疗技术的理论与技术根基。平台团队专业交叉互补，助力研究所在生物医学光子传感与诊疗领域保持国内领先。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsJ0Ce0o3OKcN3hagEUYWwjiadYswaBdJb2HpbV3ibQY9zu3PaPG1E6Whw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/lSfDibrUsADeMkez9FG6m5ibhO7icv0ibodISVI3gSJk8swibPZGGnBAK2pEIu2ZkGJI2QviawBEBPTlz2I5YdMACHrQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.师资概况</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5Umbic71T2ibA8olF6h7cvC8wyPNOOkrGDdkDIz9y4sseUoJlYFFmI0uSQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/WhFQTqV6uL2WzibxcDjPq9ZfDQWy2OC5UktSPwgG15b5taxpibdjIaN3qrpabEibflC5PYX9x1usPKfwxPngOel5A/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span><span>研究所拥有一支由多名资深博学的学术带头人及朝气蓬勃的青年骨干组成的高水平教师队伍，其中包含享受国务院特殊津贴专家</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>人，国家四青人才</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>人，海外高层次人才引进青年项目</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>人，教育部新世纪优秀人才计划</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>人，陕西高校“青年杰出人才支持计划”</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>人，陕西省省级人才</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>人，校级“小米青年学者”</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>人，校青年拔尖人才</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>人，以及西安交大十大学术新人</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>人。入选“2022年度科学影响力榜单”</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>人，“终身科学影响力榜单”</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>人。</span></span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIs2ALFNk1oFSZjSta06ZX75iabxjx6I2gSD6WOCEUDicEDvrDtQqniaPFRQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生团队</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>生物医学光谱传感技术与仪器团队</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>生物医学光谱传感课题组2007年由赵军武教授创立。团队含教育部新世纪人才、政府特殊津贴获得者及全球顶尖</span><span><span>2%</span></span><span>科学家。课题组融合先进物理与纳米光学理论，建立生物光子调控与光谱传感平台，专注纳米探针创新及早诊技术等研究，在疾病、食品安全与环境监测领域取得重要突破。至今，课题组主持30余项国家级、省部级科研项目，累计科研资金超千万，于顶级期刊发表SCI论文</span><span><span>180</span></span><span>余篇，荣获陕西省科技一等奖等多项科技大奖。</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIs5DtJZldibC0m4kNTScKPK3hjT5oExGZsD17Xfd6VxLdy2G7iaJwdQkCA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIs0q8nX55Fo3AUoStsPDg1F8UDfu7H9lKMIC33TM6ibL63ic2hspoeYupQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>赵军武 教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，博士生导师。享受国务院特殊津贴专家，享受陕西省三秦人才津贴专家，生物医学工程陕西省重点实验室主任，担任中国生物医学工程学会/生物传感技术分会委员，陕西省生物医学工程学会副理事长/传感器专业委员会主任委员。主要研究方向为纳米生物材料与器件、光学功能材料和医学信号检测与诊断仪器。主持承担国家863计划、国家自然科学基金、陕西省重点研发计划重点项目等省部级以上研究项目7项，研究经费累计1000余万，在国内外著名学术期刊发表SCI论文200余篇，获陕西省自然科学一等奖1项、陕西高等学校科学技术奖一等奖2项、河南省科技进步奖1项。</span></p><p><span>邮箱: </span></p><p><span>jwzhao@mail.xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsbIaGia9UFAxSIFibwYtQYfXumRG2EdjS4RD0ZQNghia60EJm77QwRU3SQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>朱键 教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，博士生导师。入选教育部新世纪优秀人才计划。主要研究方向为基于贵金属纳米结构SPR的生物光谱传感特性研究和计算生物纳米光学。主持国家级科研项目3项，省部级科研项目1项。在Small, Sensors &amp; Actuators B, Chemical Engineering Journal等国际学术期刊发表SCI论文180余篇，H 因子达到30。荣获王宽诚育才奖，陕西青年科技奖，陕西省自然科学一等奖，陕西高等学校科学技术一等奖，入选全球前2%顶尖科学家（2022年度及终身科学影响力榜单，斯坦福大学&amp;Elservier）。</span></p><p><span>邮箱: </span></p><p><span>zhujian@mail.xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsf5Ake34icMLDicpruZM73x13jA90yXIJ97dFcmxkTlxGfjm4MGR9ltkg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>李剑君 教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，博士生导师。主要研究方向为基于多信息融合的生物光谱传感策略与器件；生物化学反应分析与分离工程。主持国家自然科学基金、国家留学人员科技活动择优资助项目、陕西省自然科学基金等项目。研究成果获陕西省自然科学一等奖1项，陕西省高等学校科学技术奖一等奖2项。在国内外高水平期刊上发表相关科研论文150余篇，授权发明专利4项。担任中国生物医学工程学会/生物医学测量分会/生物传感分会委员，入选2022年度全球前2%顶尖科学家（斯坦福大学&amp;Elservier）。</span></p><p><span>邮箱: </span></p><p><span>jjunli@mail.xjtu.edu.cn </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsBw7GTvmcR8jdAyr6F0Sm3t65ibWsEU3YhyvkIKjfUlMVgnFgAZqHKOw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>翁国军 副教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>西安交大-佐治亚理工联合培养博士，博士生导师。主要研究方向为光谱分析与体外诊断、光学纳米材料、光催化等。主持国家自然科学基金等各类课题9项，已在Sensors and Actuators B, JPCC等国际主流SCI期刊发表论文40余篇，授权专利2项，获得2020年陕西省自然科学一等奖（R04）、2019年陕西高等学校科学技术奖一等奖（R04），兼任中国生物医学工程学会生物医学测量分会委员（2019-2027），陕西省生物医学工程学会副秘书长（2024-2028）。</span></p><p><span>邮箱:</span></p><p><span>gjweng@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsSQs7ht1kQWrOEYECNm4LqKibedvguLcBSVibT7apPZ07TfIm0mZRQDWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>吴方南 助理教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>博士，主要研究方向为荧光纳米材料的光学调控、光学生物传感应用、光学探针体外诊断等。参与和主持国家自然科学基金、博士后面上基金等各类课题。以第一作者身份在Sensors and Actuators B、Journal of Materials Chemistry C 等期刊发表SCI论文5篇。</span></span></p><p><span>邮箱:</span></p><p><span>wfn9699@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>左右滑动查看更多</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>人工智能医疗诊断团队</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>人工智能诊疗诊断团队由国内生物医学光子学先驱之一张镇西教授创建，是国内最早从事生物医学光学研究的课题组之一。团队深耕生物医学光子影像、光谱分析、光生物物理及肿瘤光学诊疗等前沿领域。近五年，团队承担国家自然科学基金重点及国际合作等项目超</span><span><span>10</span></span><span>项，累计科研资金约</span><span><span>1800</span></span><span>万元，在国际著名期刊发表论文</span><span><span>50</span></span><span>余篇，荣获陕西省科技进步一等奖与国家科技进步二等奖。</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsSlBTjjtq85ZDDXwKbssax6uYxLPticZEFCm3XOJFd4t2rsfIcVZibROA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsuPgzoA2WVUlHQib6V1e9o07icibux7qTibicIDiaiadAgaA4Gj3cF4ApUv41Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>姚翠萍 教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，博士生导师。主要研究方向AI辅助光学诊疗方法及应用；光学检测技术与仪器。主持国家自然科学基金项目5项。作为主要人员参与国际合作重点项目两项，重大仪器专项一项。在Optics Letters,Nature Communications,Optics Express 等杂志发表SCI收录论文90余篇，获授权国家发明专利11项。参与译著三本，参编教材四部。</span></p><p><span>邮箱: </span></p><p><span>zsycp@mail.xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsTuojVm1EZfnkqyx7xiaujFNLnZ1EibDWEkopUMicvyTO6p5ETia1GzP76w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>王晶 副教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，博士生导师。主要研究内容为将光学成像与机器学习等相结合，搭建光学医学仪器。主持国科金面上项目，重大仪器专项子项目及装备预研项目子项目等多项。以第一或通讯作者在Optics Express, Journal of Biomedical Optics等学术杂志发表SCI/EI收录论文10余篇，授权国家发明专利、登记软件著作权多项。</span></p><p><span>邮箱:</span></p><p><span>wangjing@mail.xjtu.edu.cn    </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsJHFCYQLvTXqGPRTAGIvOAcbALnUSYewOiasZ3vpB8xTgGNQI4Zic6Kdg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>荣强周 特聘研究员</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，博士生导师。西安交通大学青年拔尖人才B类，陕西省优博，从事光声/光学显微成像技术及其生物医学应用、3D 超声打印及其在再生医学领域的应用。分别在意大利帕多瓦大学、美国杜克大学、华盛顿大学（圣路易斯）从事博士后、研究科学家、访问研究员工作。一作（含共一）/通讯作者在Science，BME Frontier，Photoacoustics 等期刊发表 SCI 论文60篇。主持完成国家级、省部级及企业项目多项，获陕西省科技发明一等奖。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsSeQR9XacAELoUKxOZWNhdD5ZBRve77AnBxNU85A10DMkjeg9xZlfjw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>王斯佳 副教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，副教授，博士生导师。主要研究方向为肿瘤光学成像与治疗和光学免疫调控方面。承担国科金面上项目1项，青年项目1项，博士后资助项目2项，参与多项国家自然科学基金重大重点项目。近五年在Micro-nano letters ,ACS Applied Materials &amp; Interfaces等杂志上发表SCI论文10余篇。</span></p><p><span>邮箱: </span></p><p><span>wang_sijia@mail.xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIs4m5Kuq9kFGqMaVqbWaacicrxZjrXmUmB2DFNOy9dg5HqibN82cia3yoOA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>辛静 副教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，研究生导师。主要研究方向为智能化精准光学诊疗方法，以及智能化光学诊疗量化评估。主持国科学金青年和面上3项，中国博士后基金资助3项，陕西省自然科学基金一般项目1项。在Cancer letters，International journal of nanomedicine 等国际期刊发表SCI 十余篇。获得授权专利2项。</span></p><p><span>邮箱:</span></p><p><span>xinjing@mail.xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsZg9O4tL1RQzGFfhTm0QRHMfdqiaZWdVnibBicZ2gg7ptBRbl2rJTpe0Sw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>付磊 副教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，研究生导师。主要研究方向为脉冲激光诱导光致击穿及其生物医学应用，血管内钙化斑块治疗手术设备研发。主持青年基金一项，另以主要参与人参加多项国家重大科研仪器项目、国科金重点项目等科学基金项目，以第一或者共一作者身份在Optics Express、 Journal of Biomedical Optics、Ultrasonics Sonochemistry、中国激光等国际期刊上发表论文近10篇，授权国家专利2项。</span></p><p><span>邮箱: </span></p><p><span>fulei2020@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsU5XmujtQ2csU6h3XSTSPlGtZUEnicCJdt9D9hic3JLd0fp1w2dEhulHA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>杜晓凡  助理教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，主要研究方向为生物医学光学仪器，细胞光学药物递送，呼出气体光学传感，便携式高光谱仪器研发，近红外二区内镜成像。主持国家自然科学基金青年项目，中央高校基本科研业务费；以第一作者在Drug Delivery，Journal of Biomedical Optics等期刊发表SCI论文7篇；授权发明专利8项。</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span></p><p><span>dxf03@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIs2UiaH3EicjPXhYxoL6vRZXicrYpIoyc1oyas6OkZdcmP4AibPxiaM7kOv5A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>于岚  助理教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，主要研究方向为荧光相关光谱技术，共聚焦显微成像及定量相位显微成像技术等。已经在Photonics Research，ACS Photonics等期刊发表学术论文8篇，其中部分论文被选为期刊封面文章，ESI高被引论文。博士期间曾获得全国光学工程博士学术联赛百强等奖项。</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span></p><p><span>lanyu@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>左右滑动查看更多</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>生物医学光学智能传感团队</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>生物医学光学智能传感团队长期致力于化学功能分子合成、生物医学荧光染料、荧光探针与荧光功能材料和纳米离子通道薄膜器件的组装集成与应用开发等多学科交叉领域研究。团队拥有完备的有机合成、细胞成像、光学测试等实验及测试平台，主持包括国家级项目等</span><span><span>16</span></span><span>项，获国家级青年人才项目，校级创新团队支持。与钱旭红院士（华东师范大学）、Tony D. James（巴斯大学，英国）、Eric V. Anslyn（德克萨斯大学奥斯汀分校，美国）等团队密切合作。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsicwq0Oht1VKBgVglJBHBoQWDP1VeAD2Oxocx6FeUxhE5dojoicMSpQTQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsibQWCWuUVsAtib1IHjlyXFiabZFkmAGEt3eYhtXB1pNK5KkFyYicA561ww/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>孙晓龙 教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，博士生导师。入选国家青年人才计划和校青年拔尖人才支持计划A类。主要研究方向为分子识别和荧光传感研究和软物质功能材料开发及应用，发表系列高水平期刊论文，包括Nat.Chem. (IF: 23.19)、Chem.Soc. Rev. (IF: 42.8), J. Am. Chem. Soc. (IF: 14.69)、ACS Cent. Sci. (IF: 12.84)、Chem.Sci. (IF: 9.56)等。</span></p><p><span>邮箱：xs2759@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsljAwBHfhhSDgsNXZl2BFlg9ibpsmUDm0ZJ21GnxFwiaXtOjdt3K4xYnw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>付涛 副教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，研究生导师。主要研究方向为纳米生物材料、生物检测等。主持国科金、陕西省及西安市科技计划等项目。在ACS Appl. Mater. &amp; Interf.,Anal. Chem., RSC Adv.等国内外学术期刊和会议论文集发表论文130余篇，其中被SCI收录60余篇，已授权国家发明专利5项。</span></p><p><span>邮箱: </span></p><p><span>taofu@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsjEkDt6PvQezxUohe9fqHzB098d5u8OI1jCt5a47sWsDtf76t6LucYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>张慧 助理教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，孙晓龙教授团队成员。主要研究方向为荧光传感和生物成像技术。small methods等期刊发表多篇研究论文，</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span></p><p><span>huizhang@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>左右滑动查看更多</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>纳米医学及慢性疾病代谢调控团队</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>纳米医学及慢性疾病代谢调控团队拥有教育部新世纪人才及省青年拔尖人才。聚焦癌症、高血压等慢性病的代谢调控，利用组学、生物信息学揭示疾病机理，研发对疾病微环境响应的多功能纳米药物以提升靶向治疗效能，并通过纳米技术调节代谢，融合创新疗法，探索慢性病综合治疗新策略。该团队已承担</span><span><span>30</span></span><span>余项国家级、省部级项目，近五年在Nature子刊等发表高质量论文</span><span><span>30</span></span><span>余篇，获国家发明专利</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>项，彰显其在纳米医学领域的科研实力与贡献。</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIskNN8LqKn7CAiciaZ6C3kxbyd6ic6iayQXyUl9DxibBJ0e8ibN2kfnVhibKE2g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIs1JvnxVOLHUE058kJlcwsGicKQt60EXE8zazNzSguIqgh0NlyBwLwEMw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>田中民 教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，博士生导师。研究方向：盐敏感高血压的蛋白质组学及代谢组学研究。2006-2009年美国威斯康星医学院生理系博士后和访问学者；2008年入选教育部“新世纪优秀人才”支持计划；主持国家自然科学基金面上项目7项，国家社会科学基金重大项目子课题1项，在研2项。部分研究结果发表在Nature Reviews Clinical Oncology, Nature Communication, Cell Reports,Genome Research,Hypertension, Theranostics,Biomaterials, Nucleic Acids Research等学术期刊上。其中4篇论文入选 ESI 高被引用论文，1篇入选热点论文。</span></p><p><span>学术兼职：中国生理学会肾脏生理专业委员会委员。</span></p><p><span>邮箱:</span></p><p><span>zmtian@mail.xjtu.edu.cn  教师主页：https://gr.xjtu.edu.cn/web/zmtian</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIshayBN9tN2zDicva4fwwDSghzb9UVsCEP8e212u48GIOt3MxpaeE34zw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>杨哲  副教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士生导师，长期从事生物材料、纳米医学、肿瘤免疫治疗等相关方面研究，并以第一作者或通讯作者在Nature Reviews Clinical Oncology， ACS Nano, Advanced Science等国际知名期刊发表SCI论文40余篇，其中1篇IF&gt;80，13篇IF&gt;10，ESI热点论文1篇，ESI高被引论4篇; 获7项发明专利、1件实用新型专利。此外，入选陕西省青年拔尖人才计划，“陕西省普通高校青年杰出人才支持计划”等人才支持计划。</span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span></p><p><span>13669205957      </span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span></p><p><span>yangzhe@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/cU5GT12BYGdI0a8rKk66H6ahe7QHGlIsQgL0zk6ia61XcQc05NMr0BSoBnuWv9E01Uib2Fia502JEVia4narjylocw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>高迪  副教授</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>博士，硕士生导师，主要研究方向为新型可降解生物材料的设计开发、纳米医学与肿瘤免疫治疗、纳米协同光疗制剂的开发。以第一作者或通讯作者发表SCI论文